# Task 1: select a project and save it as the default.
Output task-01-first-run.gif
Set Width 1000 Height 600 FontSize 14
Type "boardwalk --help"; Enter; Sleep 1s
Type "boardwalk project list"; Enter; Sleep 2s
Type "boardwalk project use juanrubio/3 --as life-board"; Enter; Sleep 2s
Type "boardwalk item list"; Enter; Sleep 2s
